{"page":20140,"part":1,"text":"行书\n\n\n行书\n\n尝考魏、晋行书，自有一体，与草书不同。大率变真以便于挥运而已。草出于章，行出于真。虽曰行书，各有定体，纵复晋代诸贤，亦苦不相远。《兰亭记》及右军诸帖第一，谢安石、大令诸帖次之，颜、柳、苏、米亦后世可观者。大要以笔老为贵，少有失误，亦可辉映。所贵乎秾纤间出，血脉相连，筋骨老健，风神洒落，姿态备具，真有真之态度，行有行之态度，草有草之态度，必须博习，可以兼通。","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20140,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"13f02231196a8cf8a4c21c9b4c5f8a68be85047f1e72b2183206943897ae06f6","textSha256":"13f02231196a8cf8a4c21c9b4c5f8a68be85047f1e72b2183206943897ae06f6","fileSha256":"13f02231196a8cf8a4c21c9b4c5f8a68be85047f1e72b2183206943897ae06f6","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20140-work-119.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"续书谱 · 行书","sourceUrl":"https://www.wolai.com/mojiyi/kFfK8Dci4xmDsTtkMbtjRq","originalPages":[401,402],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":3,"sourceTextSha256":"b42bf348363aad93ce00890cb636943ced64e79289c21a2a0c1be45e93bbafd5","id":"local-401-250-259","page_id":401,"origin":"legacy-reviewed-txt","rawStart":250,"rawEnd":259,"reviewedTextSha256":"e5ae0859f02d6cd8113b3036fc90867e5e30190b90ec28b2868d79fb3b7017b4","displayUnitOrigins":[[256,257],[257,258],[258,259]],"legacySource":{"kind":"human-txt","page":401,"part":2,"label":"人工审核原TXT","verifiedBy":"郑雨荻","verifiedAt":"2026-10-19T14:09:39.156Z","revision":"e5ae0859f02d6cd8113b3036fc90867e5e30190b90ec28b2868d79fb3b7017b4","textSha256":"e5ae0859f02d6cd8113b3036fc90867e5e30190b90ec28b2868d79fb3b7017b4","fileSha256":"a7959b8ad3ac4b1328d4afcc5960761834bc9dbc83e2ea2d0c51808b9658a61c","txtPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-逐页校勘.txt","reviewCsvPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-TXT校验表.csv","reviewJsonPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-初筛进度备份.json"}},{"start":5,"end":7,"sourceT